# IMG-02 — Default lazy-load images (with known exceptions)

## Rationale

Default images to `loading="lazy"`. Section placement is unpredictable — neither
the agent nor the developer can reliably know if an image is above the fold,
because the same section may appear in different template positions.

**Do not lazy-load** only in these cases:

- Hero image sections
- Image banner sections
- The first image in a main product section

## How to check

Confirm each image either has `loading="lazy"` or qualifies for one of the
exceptions above.

## How to fix

**Auto-fix:** Add `loading="lazy"` to images by default.

Skip lazy-loading (or use `loading="eager"` + `fetchpriority="high"` on hero
images) only when the section matches an exception above — not based on guessed
template placement.
